# Walkthrough: Model Training Fixes

## Summary of Changes

All changes pushed to: **https://github.com/sd45g/mls-python-code-summarization** (branch: `fix/improve-model-training`)

### 🔴 Critical Fix

| File | Fix | Impact |
|------|-----|--------|
| [inference.py](file:///c:/Users/USER/Downloads/mls-python-code-summarization-main/mls-python-code-summarization-main/scripts/inference.py) | Added `[BOS]`/`[EOS]` tokens to source encoding | **Root cause of ~0 ROUGE scores** |

### 🟠 Model Improvements

| Parameter | Before | After |
|-----------|--------|-------|
| `d_model` | 256 | **512** |
| `encoder/decoder layers` | 4 | **6** |
| `dim_feedforward` | 1024 | **2048** |
| Training samples | 50,000 | **100,000** |
| Epochs | 60 | **100** |
| Early stopping patience | 4 | **8** |

