## Run on Google Colab

### Step 1: Mount Drive & Clone Repo

```python
from google.colab import drive
drive.mount('/content/drive')

!git clone https://github.com/sd45g/mls-python-code-summarization.git
%cd mls-python-code-summarization
!git checkout fix/improve-model-training
```

### Step 2: Install Dependencies

```python
!pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Step 3: Download & Preprocess Data

```python
!python scripts/preprocess_data.py
```

### Step 4: Train Tokenizer (if needed)

```python
!python scripts/train_tokenizer.py
```

### Step 5: Train Model

```python
!python scripts/train.py
```

Training will save models to: `/content/drive/MyDrive/mls-python-code-summarization/models/`

### Step 6: Evaluate ROUGE Scores

```python
!python scripts/evaluate.py
```

