## Expected Results

With these fixes, you should see:

| Metric | Before | Expected After |
|--------|--------|----------------|
| ROUGE-1 | 0.007 | **0.15-0.25** |
| ROUGE-2 | 0.0 | **0.05-0.10** |
| ROUGE-L | 0.007 | **0.12-0.20** |
| Val Accuracy | 27% | **40-50%** |
